prowess of the <strong>Ranger</strong>, the sneak attacks of the <strong>Assassin</strong>, the dark magic of the <strong>Necromance</strong>r, and much more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186580/extras/acc3fd89c7791f7f53be3d6cc59568ee.webp?t=1755243003\" width=612 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186580/extras/e1339be40f6f0b2bf1042512fd1101f5.poster.avif?t=1755243003\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186580/extras/e1339be40f6f0b2bf1042512fd1101f5.webm?t=1755243003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186580/extras/e1339be40f6f0b2bf1042512fd1101f5.mp4?t=1755243003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The path ahead of you is difficult, and you will die over and over again... But it won't be the end. A force beyond your understanding keeps bringing you back to this cursed world. Can you uncover the secrets that will allow you to break this perpetual cycle? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186580/extras/4e20abc05ec6196e0b3fa1c1a8c460e1.webp?t=1755243003\" width=612 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Deckbuilding Roguelike with Tactical 3D Grid-Based Positioning</strong>: A superb blend of environmental tactics and deep deckbuilding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Iconic Art Direction</strong>: Pixel art with high-quality shading, lighting, and effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Lots of Content</strong>: 3 heroes, 10 sidekicks, 27 enemies, 10 bosses, 6 regions, 300 hero cards, 150 sidekick cards and hundreds of relics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Huge Replayability</strong>: Each run is a new experience thanks to roguelike features, unlocks, secrets, and meta-progression.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Infinite Tactical Combos</strong>: Vanquish your enemies by combining the power of your cards, sidekicks, relics, and the terrain itself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186580/extras/67e35cc3b3a4041de0360a36c3bda807.poster.avif?t=1755243003\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186580/extras/67e35cc3b3a4041de0360a36c3bda807.webm?t=1755243003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186580/extras/67e35cc3b3a4041de0360a36c3bda807.mp4?t=1755243003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Club Sandwich"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186580/41c5fb5dc67f9cf6259ed86d9a5f1d868a0c9a0c/header.jpg?t=1755243003","is_